Great news—you’ve got a full tank and all the pre‑trip checks cleared!

Now just give the green light and I’ll crank the engine for you. 🚗💨

```json
{
  "action":"start_engine",
  "parameters":{
    "ignitionMode":"START"
  }
}
```

Let me know when you’re ready, and I’ll fire it up!
